  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/sn5gHNg.png\" width=\"638\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#0cf\"><strong>&darr;&darr;&darr; 點擊此處前往我們的網站&nbsp;&darr;&darr;&darr;</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/VVAjDy4.png\" width=\"324\" height=\"242\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Timeless and Classics Zero：<span style=\"color:#0cf\">全面重製的 TaC</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f60\"><strong>已提供 1.20.1 版本</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #cccccc;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif\"><span><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>槍械、動畫、寫實、有趣，以 Timeless 的方式打造。</strong></span></span></span></div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TpY148q.png\" width=\"100\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">支持我們的工作：<span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f90\"><a style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f90\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ClumsyAlienDev\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></span>，以及面向中國大陸玩家的 <a style=\"font-size:24px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.net%252fa%252fnekocrane\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#0cf\">愛發電</span>,</a> 您的支持能幫助開發團隊持續推出更新！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/4ulvgSx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#000\"><strong>新增內容...</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#f0f\"><strong>50</strong><strong style=\"font-size:24px\">+ 種槍械</strong></span>，每把都擁有獨特的<strong>性能</strong>、<strong>階級</strong>、<strong>模型</strong>與<strong>自訂功能<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/JNXc4dp.png\" width=\"533\" height=\"266\"></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>配件系統</strong></span>，可透過廣泛的<strong>瞄準鏡</strong>、<strong>槍口裝置</strong>、<strong>彈匣</strong>、<strong>握把</strong>與<strong>槍托</strong>來改造您的武器</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/UfIMIwX.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"535\" height=\"232\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#3cc\"><strong>塗裝</strong></span>，更換武器的<strong>顏色</strong>與<strong>模型</strong>！<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/b5d4Pzc.png\" width=\"538\" height=\"354\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>高度自訂</strong></span>，可透過本機或伺服器<strong>DataPack</strong>修改各種武器數據，並可透過<strong>ResourcePack</strong>更改外觀與音效！<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/VI18nxl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"532\" height=\"290\"></span></li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#008080\"><strong>*相關連結：</strong></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000\">完美相容 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yes-steve-model\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yes, Steve model mod</a> </span>，提供獨一無二的第三人稱動畫！</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/GQZdzk5.png\" width=\"345\" height=\"201\"></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000\">社群擴充套件：</span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-guns-lesraisins-append-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:600\">LesRaisins Append Pack</span></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>安裝說明</strong></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><strong>需要<span style=\"color:#f00\">（強制）</span>：</strong>&nbsp;在遊玩任何<strong>TaC&nbsp;</strong>版本前，請先安裝模組 <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obfuscate/files/3740120\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\">Obfuscate</span>&nbsp;</strong></a>（MC1.18.2 版本請改用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\">Framework</span></strong></span></a>），建議使用最新版本！</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><strong>需要<span style=\"color:#f60\">（0.3.9 以下版本）</span><strong>&nbsp;</strong>:</strong>&nbsp;模組 <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios/files/3661903\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong style=\"font-size:24px\">Curios</strong></a></span></span>！<strong>&nbsp;為了讓護甲套裝正常運作，必須</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><strong>特別注意</strong> </strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#000\"><strong>使用版本為 <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong style=\"font-size:24px\">4.0.8.1</strong></span></strong>！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 自 0.3.10 版本起已不再需要 Curios！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>關於 MC1.18.2 的 Beta 版本 0.3.10</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">此為測試版本，可能存在無法預期的錯誤，請自行承擔安裝風險</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&middot; 已不再需要 Curios。同時也不再需要 Obfuscate，改為需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">Framework</span></a>。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&middot; 遊戲內調整設定的介面存在錯誤，目前正在修復中，暫時移除。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&middot; 護甲套裝（Armor Rig）回歸，可使用快捷鍵（預設 O）進行裝備/卸下。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&middot; 已修改瞄準鏡倍率運算邏輯，但雙重渲染的倍率出現異常。您需要在 config/tac-client.toml 中將 scopeDoubleRender 設定為 false。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&middot; 0.3.9 更新的塗裝系統因需進行功能調整，已暫時移除。僅保留塗裝物品，但實際不會生效。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&middot; 若使用 OptiFine，請下載並使用「tac-a-0.3.10-1.18.2-optifine.jar」檔案，否則遊戲將會崩潰。</strong></span></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>槍械動畫範例（約 0.3.2 版本）</strong></span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/syT0p51WaHc\" height=\"838\" width=\"838\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>其他連結：</strong></span><br> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/rDztDFArgH\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets-global.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/636e0a69f118df70ad7828d4_icon_clyde_blurple_RGB.svg\" width=\"109\" height=\"82\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBPg0qLkNV6MzHinm0CmaYQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.freeiconspng.com/uploads/youtube-icon-app-logo-png-9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"99\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ClumsyAlienDev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/NtIKbwU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"99\" height=\"99\"></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mcbbs.net%252fforum.php%253fmod%253dviewthread%2526tid%253d1264237\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/NpTMSPo.png\" alt=\"https://imgur.com/NpTMSPo.png\" width=\"279\" height=\"95\"></a>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color:#f90\"><em><strong>主要開發者：</strong></em></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">ClumsyAlien</strong></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">&nbsp;</span>（Java 開發者 / 創辦人）</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">NekoCrane</strong></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">&nbsp;</span>（首席美術 / 創辦人）Twitter: @CraneNeko</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>Receke</strong>（美術）</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>Mayday</strong>（動畫開發 / Java 開發）</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>alex_n_italy</strong>（美術）</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">Hatt</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;（美術）</span></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>Mecha</strong>（美術）</span></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Pos_2333</strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;（美術）</span><br> <strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Spacebar</strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;（首席動畫設計師）</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Mr_K</strong>&nbsp;（動畫設計師）</span><br> <strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">IronCurtain</strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;（音效工程師）</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>Gaint_Salted_Fish&nbsp;</strong>（Java 開發者）<br><strong>Chris Linefield&nbsp;</strong>（Java 開發者）<br></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">TaoismDeepLake</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">（Java 開發者）</span></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>Fiz</strong>&nbsp;</strong>（Java 開發者 / 資料科學家）</span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/uX3xub8.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"361\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><em><strong>貢獻者：</strong></em></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Kacper</strong>（音效工程師 / 輔助建模師）</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>OddlyDelta</strong>&nbsp;（動畫師）Twitter: @OddlyDelta</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Bomb787</strong>（Java 開發者 / 槍械「專家」）</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>Danny</strong>（建模師）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>DarkSoul38 </strong>（建模師）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">LesRaisins Studio </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">（擴充套件開發者）</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
